@startuml target_help_global_classes
title Recommended Global Command Structure - Agent Help Proposal
top to bottom direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam nodesep 20
skinparam ranksep 35
skinparam linetype ortho
' Source evidence: pi-mono-java@d8e22562 modules/coding-agent-cli/src/main/java/com/campusclaw/codingagent/runtime/MateServiceClient.java AgentRuntime.
' Source evidence: pi-mono-java@d8e22562 modules/coding-agent-cli/src/main/java/com/campusclaw/codingagent/runtime/AgentRuntimeManager.java prepareCached, toIdentity:630, toRuntime:646, AgentIdentity:717.
' Source evidence: pi-mono-java@d8e22562 modules/coding-agent-cli/src/main/java/com/campusclaw/codingagent/runtime/PreparedAgentRuntime.java metadata.
' Source evidence: pi-mono-java@d8e22562 modules/coding-agent-cli/src/main/java/com/campusclaw/codingagent/runtimeapi/command/execution/CommandExecutionContext.java session and catalog.
' Observed behavior: upstream AgentRuntime has userCases, but the local identity omits it and reload supplies an empty list.
' Design reason: keep the whole command structure visible while Help projects authored Agent metadata, not command descriptors.
' Product constraint: Help explains the Agent; Slash discovery remains in the command catalog.
' Target-only: all nodes and relations describe the proposed assembly; existing SPI and Runtime collaborators are reused.

package "Web boundary" {
  class RuntimeCommandController {
    +list(sessionId)
    +execute(sessionId, request)
  }
  class "Command Request VOs\nImmutable Response VOs" as CommandVOs
}
package "Application layer - singleton" {
  class CommandCatalogService
  class CommandExecutionService
  class CommandResponseAssembler
}
package "Command core" {
  class CompositeCommandRegistry
  class ResolvedCommandCatalog <<request snapshot>>
  interface CommandDefinitionSource
  class BuiltinCommandSource
  class SkillCommandSource
  interface BuiltinCommandContributor
  class BuiltinCommandDefinition
  interface CommandHandler
  interface CommandAdmissionPolicy
}
package "Builtin adapters - singleton" {
  class "HelpContributor + 6 Contributors" as Contributors
  class HelpCommandHandler #E3F2E1
  class AgentHelpQueryService #E3F2E1
  class "6 Other Builtin Handlers\nand Narrow Services" as OtherBuiltins
}
package "Runtime and persistence" {
  class AgentRuntimeManager
  class PreparedAgentRuntime <<query snapshot>> #E3F2E1
  class "AgentIdentity\nagent.json" as AgentIdentity <<stored metadata>> #E3F2E1 {
    name / displayName
    description[]
    userCases[] (retain on reload)
  }
  class MateServiceClient
  class "Runtime execution / Repository" as RuntimePorts <<grouped>>
}

RuntimeCommandController --> CommandCatalogService
RuntimeCommandController --> CommandExecutionService
RuntimeCommandController ..> CommandVOs
CommandCatalogService --> CompositeCommandRegistry
CommandCatalogService ..> CommandVOs : descriptor DTO to VO
CommandExecutionService --> CompositeCommandRegistry
CommandExecutionService --> CommandResponseAssembler
CommandResponseAssembler ..> CommandVOs : HelpResultDTO to response VO
CompositeCommandRegistry o-- "1..*" CommandDefinitionSource
BuiltinCommandSource ..|> CommandDefinitionSource
SkillCommandSource ..|> CommandDefinitionSource
CompositeCommandRegistry --> ResolvedCommandCatalog : one resolution
BuiltinCommandSource o-- "7" BuiltinCommandContributor
Contributors ..|> BuiltinCommandContributor
BuiltinCommandContributor --> BuiltinCommandDefinition : contributes
ResolvedCommandCatalog o-- "0..*" BuiltinCommandDefinition : selected Builtin view
BuiltinCommandDefinition *-- "1" CommandHandler
BuiltinCommandDefinition *-- "1" CommandAdmissionPolicy
CommandExecutionService --> BuiltinCommandDefinition : select / admit / execute
HelpCommandHandler ..|> CommandHandler
OtherBuiltins ..|> CommandHandler
Contributors --> HelpCommandHandler : Help binding
Contributors --> OtherBuiltins : other bindings
HelpCommandHandler --> AgentHelpQueryService : authorized Session agentId
AgentHelpQueryService --> AgentRuntimeManager : prepareCached once
AgentHelpQueryService ..> PreparedAgentRuntime : public fields only
AgentRuntimeManager --> PreparedAgentRuntime : load complete snapshot
AgentRuntimeManager --> AgentIdentity : publish / reload userCases
AgentRuntimeManager --> MateServiceClient : existing explicit refresh only
SkillCommandSource --> AgentRuntimeManager
OtherBuiltins --> RuntimePorts
CommandExecutionService --> RuntimePorts : Session access

RuntimeCommandController -[hidden]down-> CommandCatalogService
CommandCatalogService -[hidden]down-> CompositeCommandRegistry
BuiltinCommandSource -[hidden]down-> Contributors

note bottom of AgentHelpQueryService
No catalog formatting, model call, or refresh.
No prompt or binding details in the response.
Cache reads serialize with Agent publication.
end note
legend bottom left
Target-only global proposal; green marks the Help metadata path.
Repeated collaborators are grouped, not omitted.
Core/application services are singleton; response data is request-scoped.
RuntimePorts includes singleton services and execution-scoped Session objects.
endlegend
@enduml
